  "description": "This is a C#.Net solution that provides the capability to easily render PDF documents with a templating approach using your choice of templating technology (e.g. Xslt, Razor Mvc templates, or custom) and the legacy Fonet XslFO in-memory rendering egine. It's based on the Xsl-FO standard for robust paged media generation and currently is dependent on an old but still functional libray \"Fonet\" -- which is port of an old version of Apache FOP to C#.",
